  "fields": {
    "narrative": "A caller creates the virtual compound key ShardKey<int, short, byte, string>(3, 2, 77, 9, \"X\"), sends its external key to another boundary, and reconstructs the same key. In a result set containing that key plus keys on shards 3, 6, and 7, foreign-shard selection returns only 6 and 7. When refreshed records include the same compound key with updated data, merge replaces that record by complete identity; an unmatched refreshed record is appended only when requested.",
